│                                                          │
│ 1. DATA LOADING                                        │
│    DataCollator batches padded tensors                 │
│    (Dynamic padding to max in batch)                  │
│                                                          │
│ 2. FORWARD PASS                                        │
│    ├── Activations (checkpointed for memory)          │
│    ├── Loss (only on non-masked labels)               │
│    └── LoRA weights process input                     │
│                                                          │
│ 3. BACKWARD PASS                                       │
│    ├── Gradient computation (LoRA only)               │
│    ├── Gradient accumulation                          │
│    └── Gradients stored in .grad attributes           │
│                                                          │
│ 4. OPTIMIZATION (every 8 steps)                       │
│    ├── AdamW optimizer step                           │
│    │   weights = weights - lr × gradients             │
│    └── Zero gradients                                 │
│                                                          │
│ 5. LOGGING (every 10 steps)                            │
│    ├── W&B: loss, metrics                             │
│    ├── W&B: sample outputs                            │
│    └── W&B: memory usage                              │
│                                                          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

